---
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content'

const [next] = await getCollection('next')
const { Content } = await render(next)
---

<section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-4 py-4">
    <div class="max-w-screen-lg sm:text-lg">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-extrabold text-orange-800 md:text-4xl dark:text-orange-200">
        Monthly Meetings
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
        Every month, we hold two meetings. The first meeting starts at 10:00am covers a range of
        topics including Health, Aged Care, Travel, Technology, Retirement services, etc.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
        After some refreshments, our second meeting at 11:30am covers financial and investment
        topics including Superannuation, Retirement income, Investment Markets, Financial Trends,
        etc.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4 font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
        If you are retired or approaching retirement, come along, meet new friends and receive
        useful information to help your retirement.
      </p>
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
        Next Meeting: {next.data.title}
      </h2>
      <section class="prose prose-gray lg:prose-xl dark:prose-invert mx-auto max-w-screen-lg">
        <Content />
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
